    },
    {
      "id": "blk_5f12db2f",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在古龙的袭击之下幸存的愚人——也就是修会所谓的朝圣者们，随着环绕悲叹墓岛的暖流漂泊至一处巨大的溶洞。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 2,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 3,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_a4a81505",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "愚人们以此为据点，组建了剧团，希望有朝一日能够揭露修会所隐瞒的真相，重返故乡。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_17caea05",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "为此，愚人剧团撰写了诸多剧目，并“戴着镣铐起舞”，于列岛巡回演出。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 4,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 5,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_5da3ae58",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "多年来，他们一直期望着拉古那重新举办狂欢节，在那时凭借自己编写的剧目揭露真相，夺得桂冠，并取得聆听岁主神谕的机会。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 5,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 6,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    }
  ]
}